    "message": "Run the Project screen's main flow over HTTP\n\nA real loopback server takes the same requests demo-v2.js sends:\npreview the shared form, approve and run it, preview and approve an\nintervention typed as text, run both Branches and read the comparison.\nThe arrivals show in the comparison, and the main line ends at the\ngenerated_small hash pinned in the regression contract (#87).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
